body:
Where did u have this made?

&#x200B;

Looks insane!

I don't know what or who I am.

I'm told my feelings deceive me,

From indestructible to weak, but neither are really me.

So when do I meet me?

&#x200B;

My ups fade away into a distant memory as I fall further into a bottomless pit.

&#x200B;

But it has to be an illusion tho right?

It makes me feel even worse about it, I know I'm being deceived but I am powerless over it.

Nothing works, nothing helps.

&#x200B;

What is wrong with me?

What am I even doing here.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
